<title>NEW ZEALAND: Chris Holmes appointed Pure NZ CEO.</title>
<headline>Chris Holmes appointed Pure NZ CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vending machines group Pure New Zealand Ltd said on Tuesday that it had appointed Chris Holmes to the new position of chief executive.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom +64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
